 "description": "{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"Rally your elemental army and bring some primordial punishment to your opponents with this five-color Commander deck from \"},{\"attributes\":{\"italic\":true},\"insert\":\"Lorwyn Eclipsed\"},{\"insert\":\".\\n\\nThis list features two new Commanders: Ashling, the Limitless and Mass of Mysteries. Alongside those two, new cards include Jubiliation, Impulsivity, Lamentation, Belonging, Subterfuge, Elemental Spectacle, Springleaf Parade, Rain-slicked Copse, Sodden Verdure and Abundant Countryside. \\n\\nThe deck also includes first-ever reprints of two \"},{\"attributes\":{\"italic\":true},\"insert\":\"Shadowmoor \"},{\"insert\":\"rares: Slithermuse and Cream of the Crop.\\n\"}]}",
